ociation":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Follow-up deferred from #200 (unit-reader pin, answering 6095612837).\n\n**Problem**\n- `Methodology.qudtUnit` is a QUDT identifier override, and nothing checks it against the controlled reporting unit (`Analysis.unitCode` / `Analysis.units`).\n- `resultWriteService.numericReportingUnit` (`server/services/resultWriteService.js:303-304`) falls back to `ctx.method?.unit`, but the Prisma `Methodology` model has no `unit` scalar, so that fallback is never used.\n\n**Change (to be scoped)**\n- Decide whether a method may report in a unit different from its analysis.\n- If it may, add a controlled per-method unit code that references `Unit(code)`, with no QUDT-to-display mapping inferred.\n- Define the refusal when a method's QUDT override and its controlled unit disagree.\n- Remove or wire up the dead `ctx.method?.unit` fallback, with tests.\n\n**Guardrails**\n- No conversion.\n- No rewrite of existing `Result.unit` values or other stored units.\n- Additive migration only.\n- Per-lab policy goes through policyService.\n\n**Out of scope:** #200 import matching, which follows the pin on #200.\n\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_","closed_by":{"login":"yigini","id":32960535,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyOTYwNTM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32960535?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini","html_url":"https://github.com/yigini","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yigini/subscriptions","organizations